# Files kept out of the public Vercel deployment.
# The deployed site needs only: index.html, styles.css, *.js, manifest.webmanifest,
# data/cloud.config.js, data/bank.js, data/signs.js, data/precache.js, assets/.

# Build tooling - not part of the site
tools/*.py
tools/__pycache__/
supabase/

# Source content and documents - not needed at runtime (data/bank.js is the bundle)
docs/
data/questions.rw.json
data/questions_raw.txt
data/parse_report.txt
data/drafts/
data/overrides.json
data/CHANGELOG.md
README.md
INZIRA-VERCEL-DEPLOYMENT-READINESS.md

# tools/review.html is intentionally published so the in-app "Umwarimu" link works.
